}

::ENG3_U06_UA_Q20::
Question ID: ENG3_U06_UA_Q20
MLA.ENG3.L.01
Context: A slide title has incorrect capitalization.
Why should it be revised?{
~A. Titles never matter in presentations.#Incorrect. Titles guide audience understanding. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
