}

::ENG3_U06_UA_Q23::
Question ID: ENG3_U06_UA_Q23
MLA.ENG3.C.03
Context: A LAN publication has no clear audience.
What should the writer do?{
~A. Publish anyway because anyone might read it.#Incorrect. A specific audience guides revision. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
