}

::ENG3_U06_UA_Q25::
Question ID: ENG3_U06_UA_Q25
MLA.ENG3.C.03
Context: A student describes mastery for Unit 6.
Which statement is strongest?{
~A. I can decorate slides and skip writing revision.#Incorrect. Unit 6 requires communication, writing quality, and publication readiness. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
